{"4089490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MagicGourd", "steam_appid": 4089490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The inspiration comes from the classic Chinese masterpiece &quot;Journey to the West&quot;. There is a very famous plot in it, where a monster named Silver-Horned King once used the magic weapon of the Purple-Gold Red Gourd to swallow the invincible Sun Wukong. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, I designed the very interesting ability of this magic weapon into the prototype of the game play. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And this work is completely independently developed by me. I encountered various difficulties during the development process, and it was very not easy. Your purchase will be the greatest support for me!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devour objects, Eject Items</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089490/extras/9f6ade837128378e230ca7ac00f5f1a3.poster.avif?t=1765783869\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089490/extras/9f6ade837128378e230ca7ac00f5f1a3.webm?t=1765783869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089490/extras/9f6ade837128378e230ca7ac00f5f1a3.mp4?t=1765783869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete puzzles, trigger upgrades, unlock magic power and size, until devouring everything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089490/extras/b46b33db489ddd2b19bc6e2a0